  "editorialNotes": [
    "Title-screen tips use polite plural Bulgarian, retain every input name and number, and use locked glossary terms for tools, residents and the Prairie King minigame.",
    "CalicoJack remains unchanged as the canonical one-word minigame name; blackjack actions are localized as concise button labels.",
    "The two grandchild labels preserve their explicit source gender."
